<lb n="2"/>wir ehren, liebs, und guots vermögend <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuovor</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">frome</unclear>, fürsichtige,
<lb n="3"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ehrsame</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">weiße</unclear> insonders <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guote</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fründt</unclear>, und getrüwe <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">liebe</unclear>
<lb n="4"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachpären</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eß</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">habend</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unß</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unßer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beßonders</unclear> liebe, und getrüwe
